            "review_title": "Review at Casa España Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Koi\nHanoi, Vietnam88 contributions\n1\nBest Spanish restaurant in Hanoi\nAug 2020 • Solo\nI think \"Casa Espana\" is the best Spanish restaurant in Hanoi. Lunch set menu (attached photo) was reasonable price and each dishes were very tasty. I tried other set menu as well and they served us cold cuts board, 3 tapas and main dish. If you will go there, I recommend you to drink Barcelona Beer at same time. Enjoyed their food and atmosphere, that's why I give them 5* rating. Thanks Casa Espana.\nRead more\nWritten August 5, 2020\nCasa VN\nHi Koichiro, we are delighted to hear you had amazing experience with us. Thank you for having taken your time to provide us with your valuable feedback ! We look forward to having you dine with us again.\nRead more\nWritten August 6, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
